Horseless Indrajit duels Lakṣmaṇa on foot like bull elephants --- Indrajit rains shafts and pierces Lakṣmaṇa forehead as Lakṣmaṇa parries --- Lakṣmaṇa shines three peaked as both wound all limbs --- Vibhīṣaṇa hurls five vajra shafts into foe bleeding chest --- Indrajit takes Yama shaft as Lakṣmaṇa takes Kubēra dreamed shaft --- Shafts strike mouth to mouth shattering hundredfold to earth --- Lakṣmaṇa takes Varuṇa as Indrajit hurls Raudra while gods guard Lakṣmaṇa --- Lakṣmaṇa fits Indra shaft that once felled dānavas --- Lakṣmaṇa swears by Rāma truth and beheads helmeted Indrajit --- Rākṣasa host drops weapons flees to Laṅkā sea mountain as monkeys gods Brahmāṇas rejoice
